  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your knowledge of vital areas is enhanced, and your debilitating strikes land with uncanny precision.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Mantis Wisdom<sup>UC</sup>.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Add one-half your mythic tier (minimum 1) to your monk level to determine which effects you inflict with your Stunning Fist, as the monk class feature. If you miss with an unarmed Stunning Fist attack while using Mantis Style, you can expend one use of mythic power to reroll that attack. You must take the result of the second roll, even if it is lower.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-combat-a-m-feats#toc216\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
